# Cursor Rules for Blumon Project

## Development Server
- NEVER run `npm run dev` - the user handles this themselves
- The project is set up with hot reload, so changes will be reflected automatically
- Focus on making code changes and let the user manage the dev server

## Code Style
- Use TypeScript for type safety
- Follow Svelte 5 best practices
- Use proper event typing for CustomEvent handlers
- Maintain clean, readable code structure 